hadiths[38]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1711","Yahya related to me from Malik that Muhammad ibn Abi Umama ibn Sahl ibn Hunayf heard his father say"
"1712","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab that Abu Umama ibn Sahl ibn Hunayf said"
"1713","Yahya related to me from Malik that Humayd ibn Qays al-Makki said"
"1714","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Sulayman ibn Yasar that Urwa ibn az-Zubayr told him that the Messenger of Allah"
"1715","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1716","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yazid ibn Khusayfa that Urwa ibn az-Zubayr said that he heard A'isha"
"1717","Yahya related to me from Malik that Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Sasaca said that he heard Abu'l-Hubab Said ibn Yasar say that he had heard Abu Hurayra say"
"1718","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that death came to a man in the time of the Messenger of Allah"
"1719","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yazid ibn Khusayfa that Amr ibn Abdullah ibn Kab as-Salami told him that Nafi ibn Jubayr told him that Uthman ibn Abi al-As came to the Messenger of Allah"
"1720","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az- Zubayr from A'isha that the Messenger of Allah"
"1721","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman that Abu Bakr as-Siddiq visited A'isha while she had a [health] complaint and a jewish woman was making incantation (ruqya) for her. Abu Bakr said"
"1722","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that a man received a wound in the time of the Messenger of Allah"
"1723","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said"
"1724","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar cauterized for the palsy and he had a talisman made for a scorpion sting"
"1725","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from Fatima bint al-Mundhir that whenever a woman who had a fever"
"1726","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"1727","Malik related to me from Nafi from Ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1728","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard from Jabir ibn Abdullah that the Messenger of Allah"
"1729","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard from Bukayr ibn Abdullah ibn al-Ashajj from Ibn Atiya that the Messenger of Allah"
"1838","Malik related to me from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1839","Malik related to me from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1840","Malik related to me from his paternal uncle Abu Suhayl ibn Malik from his father that Abu Hurayra said"
"1841","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Abu'l-Hubab Said ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1842","Malik related to me that Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha heard Anas ibn Malik say"
"1843","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam that the Messenger of Allah"
"1844","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam from Amr ibn Muadh al- Ashali al-Ansari that his grandmother said"
"1845","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard that a beggar asked A'isha"
"1846","Yahya related to me that Malik said"
"1847","Malik related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Ata ibn Yazid al-Laythi from Abu Said al-Khudri that some people of the Ansar asked the Messenger of Allah"
"1848","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1849","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1850","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1851","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that a man of the Banu Asad said"
"1852","Yahya related that Malik heard al-Ala ibn Abd ar-Rahman say"
"1853","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"1854","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"1855","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that his father said"
"1856","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard that Luqman al-Hakim made his will and counselled his son"